### 1. Request OTP — new user (creates account + sends OTP)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ipdxd97680@minitts.net"
}

###

### 2. Verify OTP
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ipdxd97680@minitts.net",
  "otp": "775314"
}

###

### 3. Refresh access token — paste refreshToken from step 2 response
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "a93fbf02-18d2-4617-9c9f-b80ed080493c"
}

###

### 4. Logout — paste accessToken from step 2 response
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJpcGR4ZDk3NjgwQG1pbml0dHMubmV0Iiwicm9sZSI6IkNBUl9PV05FUiIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODQxNDA3NCwiZXhwIjoxNzc4NTAwNDc0fQ.31HQVxFI80UPb3qlnV3jsBsbfai1Rvr2IRxBsrdBpeA

###

### 5. Hit a protected route with no token
GET http://localhost:8080/test/nearby-shops?lat=31.5204&lng=74.3587

###

### 6. Get a valid access token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "odldx49891@minitts.net"
}

###

### 7. Verify OTP
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "odldx49891@minitts.net",
  "otp": "869961"
}

###

### 8. Hit the protected route with a valid token
GET http://localhost:8080/test/nearby-shops?lat=31.5204&lng=74.3587

###

### 9. Hit with an invalid token
GET http://localhost:8080/test/nearby-shops?lat=31.5204&lng=74.3587
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1KiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJvZGxkeDQ5ODkxQG1pbml0dHMubmV0Iiwicm9sZSI6IkNBUl9PV05FUiIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODQxNzkzOCwiZXhwIjoxNzc4NTA0MzM4fQ.Ei5G-4Gp3OsYPMaJv3bnwG4IsmG673pf9kK9IUk0o_8


